{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\ud83c\udfa7\ud83e\udd10FOR THE BEST EXPERIENCE PLAY THE GAME WITH A MICROPHONE\ud83e\udd10\ud83c\udfa7</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into Eli\u2019s first nightmare: a forest warped into cages and whispers. Something stalks the dark, and your only hope of escape lies in finding a single hidden doll.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you will:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore</strong> a haunted forest filled with eerie details.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/56461ef60df5ef9a90e52bcb70109869.poster.avif?t=1756154951\" width=692 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/56461ef60df5ef9a90e52bcb70109869.webm?t=1756154951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/56461ef60df5ef9a90e52bcb70109869.mp4?t=1756154951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Avoid the presence</strong> that hunts you in the dark.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/e742e607a1f663083cfdfd9847f60525.poster.avif?t=1756154951\" width=692 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/e742e607a1f663083cfdfd9847f60525.webm?t=1756154951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/e742e607a1f663083cfdfd9847f60525.mp4?t=1756154951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stay silent.</strong> The game listens through your microphone\u2014if you scream, gasp, or make a sound, the nightmare resets.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/913628ee1e11d3e8effe86fe9d80fe84.poster.avif?t=1756154951\" width=692 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/913628ee1e11d3e8effe86fe9d80fe84.webm?t=1756154951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/913628ee1e11d3e8effe86fe9d80fe84.mp4?t=1756154951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Solve puzzles</strong> to progress deeper into the dream.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/extras/c6cec7bde32640ec2129edcd1d257c2e.avif?t=1756154951\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo introduces the core mechanics of exploration, puzzle-solving, and the unique voice-sensitive restart system. Can you stay quiet long enough to survive the dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910010?t=1756154951","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910010?t=1756154951","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910010/fd30eafc2f6a0f7e2b1420da7c215d05ae874608/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756154951","capsule_imagev5":"htt